WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.294
Three ways to keep your work: presets save a look, projects save everything, and recordings save the picture.

2
00:00:07.759 --> 00:00:11.030
In Presets, name the current look and click Save Current.

3
00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.842
It joins your saved presets, ready to load later.

4
00:00:14.294 --> 00:00:17.637
Try another look, then load yours back from the saved list.

5
00:00:19.568 --> 00:00:26.664
Project, at the top of the Synth tab, saves the whole workspace: settings, presets, timelines and patches.

6
00:00:26.664 --> 00:00:29.877
Save As asks for a name, and the file downloads.

7
00:00:30.328 --> 00:00:33.006
Record captures the output as a video file.

8
00:00:33.006 --> 00:00:35.622
Start, let it run, then Stop and Download.

9
00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:40.642
Share broadcasts the output live.

10
00:00:40.642 --> 00:00:46.229
Start Broadcast gives you a link and a QR code; anyone who opens it watches in their browser.

11
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:51.834
WHIP output streams to OBS, MediaMTX or Cloudflare instead, for bigger audiences.

12
00:00:52.286 --> 00:00:54.284
That covers the intermediate course.

13
00:00:54.284 --> 00:00:56.837
The advanced lessons start with deep patching.
